<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves dips to $3.502 bln to Dec 4.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves dips to $3.502 bln to Dec 4.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Monday said its hard currency reserves dipped to $3.502 billion as of December 18, from $3.546 billion on December 4.</p>
<p>  HARD CURRENCY RESERVES     Dec 18    Dec 4   Nov 27   Jan 3</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	  3.502     3.546   3.552    3.424</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	     1.877     1.250   1.206    1.599</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector	5.379     4.797   4.757    5.024</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
